<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Clariant.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Clariant.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Clariant AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    800 CHF		   PREMIUM     14.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.6 CHF		   GEARING     10.5 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 18.APR.97-18.SEP.98   PAYDATE    18.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  760 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
